@api = https://localhost:7001

### 200 - Success: all tasks
GET {{api}}/api/tasks

### 404 - Not found: a task that doesn't exist
GET {{api}}/api/tasks/999999

### 400 - Bad request: ALL errors listed (missing title + bad columnId)
POST {{api}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "columnId": "abc"
}
### Login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Logout
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "D2E5A49B5F5C3F7C139D90101512E95AB45A70564C8B1CB29CF78E9D162B7A21" }

### Refresh
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "369B3298964578DAEECF54734584D257A6715BDD1D4BD95DA5995DF455B846F4" }